        "owner_reply": "Hello,\nWe're sorry to hear that the return process was inconvenient for you, especially since you had to rely on your grandchildren to print the return label. We understand how frustrating that must have been, and we sincerely apologize for the inconvenience.\nAfter reviewing your order, we can confirm that we have received your return request. Your refund is currently being processed, and we kindly ask for your patience while it is completed.\nIf you have any further questions or need any additional assistance, please don't hesitate to contact us at service@cs.halara.com (mailto:service@cs.halara.com). We're always here to help.",
